const RECAPS = {"1":{"en":"Day 1 of the Aki Basho opened clean at the top: Yokozuna Onosato, Ozeki Kirishima and Kotozakura, Ozeki Aonishiki, and Sekiwake Atamifuji and Fujinokawa all won to share the early lead at 1‑0. Jūryō call‑up Dewanoryu, filling in for an absent wrestler, beat Shonannoumi by force‑out in his manga debut.","jp":"秋場所初日、横綱・大の里、大関・霧島と琴櫃、大関・安青錨、関脆・熱海富士と藤ノ川がそろって勝利し、1勝0敗で早くも上位に並んだ。十両から呼ばれた出羽ノ龍は、マンガ初登場で湘南乃海を寄り切りで下した。"},"2":{"en":"Day 2 kept the pace unchanged at the top: Onosato, Kirishima, Kotozakura and Aonishiki all moved to 2‑0, joined by Maegashira Takanosho climbing into the perfect group. Jūryō guest Kyokukaiyu lost his outing to Toshinofuji by force‑out.","jp":"2日目も上位に動きなし。大の里、霧島、琴櫃、安青錨が2勝0敗を守り、前頭・隆の勝も加わった。十両から招かれた旭海雄は寿之富士に寄り切りで敗れた。"},"3":{"en":"Day 3 brought the tournament's first real shock at the top: Maegashira Takayasu pulled down Ozeki Kirishima to end his perfect start, while Onosato, Kotozakura and Aonishiki stayed unbeaten at 3‑0. Jūryō guest Daiseizan beat Tokihayate by force‑out.","jp":"3日目、上位に初の波乱。前頭・高安が大関・霧島を引き落としで破り、霧島の全勝が止まった。大の里、琴櫃、安青錨は3連勝を守った。十両から招かれた大青山は時疾風を寄り切りで下した。"},"4":{"en":"Day 4 produced the tournament's biggest upset yet: Maegashira Takayasu struck again, sending Yokozuna Onosato to his first defeat by frontal thrust‑down. Ozeki Kotozakura seized the sole lead at 4‑0. Jūryō guest Kazuma lost to Asasuiryu by under‑shoulder swing‑down.","jp":"4日目、今場所最大の波乱。前頭・高安が再び金星級の一番を演じ、横綱・大の里を突き落としで初黒星に追い込んだ。大関・琴櫃が4戦全勝で単独トップに立った。十両から招かれた一意は朝翠龍に肩透かしで敗れた。"},"5":{"en":"Day 5 shook up the Ozeki ranks: Maegashira Gonoyama pushed down Aonishiki, and Maegashira Churanoumi upset Kotozakura by push‑out. Six wrestlers are now tied for the lead at 4‑1 — Onosato, Kirishima, Kotozakura, Atamifuji, Churanoumi and Roga. Jūryō guest Tamawashi lost to Chiyoshoma by force‑out.","jp":"5日目は大関陣が苦戦。前頭・豪ノ山が安青錨を押し倒し、前頭・美ノ海は琴櫃を押し出しで破った。大の里、霧島、琴櫃、熱海富士、美ノ海、狼雅の6人が4勝1敗で首位に並ぶ。十両から招かれた玉鷲は千代翔馬に寄り切りで敗れた。"},"6":{"en":"Day 6 saw Kirishima's struggles continue as Maegashira Yoshinofuji threw the Ozeki down by overarm throw, dropping him further off the pace. Six wrestlers now share the lead at 5‑1 — Onosato, Kotozakura, Atamifuji, Churanoumi, Asanoyama and Ura. Jūryō guest Onokatsu lost to Tobizaru by slap‑down.","jp":"6日目も霧島の苦戦が続く。前頭・義ノ富士が上手投げで大関を破り、霧島はさらに優勝争いから後退した。大の里、琴櫃、熱海富士、美ノ海、朝乃山、宇良の6人が5勝1敗で首位に並んだ。十両から招かれた阿武剣は翔猫に叩き込みで敗れた。"},"7":{"en":"Day 7 was quiet at the very top — Onosato and Kotozakura both won to stay locked together at 6‑1, while Kirishima, Atamifuji, Fujinokawa and Churanoumi all sit one game back at 5‑2. Jūryō guest Kazekeno lost to Shonannoumi by overarm throw.","jp":"7日目は上位に大きな動きなし。大の里と琴櫃がともに勝利し、6勝1敗で並走。霧島、熱海富士、藤ノ川、美ノ海は1差の5勝2敗で追う。十両から招かれた風賢央は湘南乃海に上手投げで敗れた。"},"8":{"en":"Day 8 saw Onosato move a full game clear at 7‑1 as Kotozakura, Atamifuji, Fujinokawa and Churanoumi all sit at 6‑2 behind him. Churanoumi provided the day's upset, pushing down Ozeki Kirishima. Jūryō guest Mitakeumi lost his manga debut to Toshinofuji by frontal crush‑down.","jp":"8日目、大の里が7勝1敗として単独トップを１差に広げた。琴櫃、熱海富士、藤ノ川、美ノ海が6勝2敗で追う。この日の波乱は前頭・美ノ海が大関・霧島を押し倒した一番。十両から招かれた御嵌海はマンガ初登場を寿之富士に寄り倒しで飾れなかった。"},"9":{"en":"Day 9 stayed spotless at the very top: Yokozuna Onosato dispatched Fujiryoga by hand‑pull‑down to move to 8‑1, keeping sole control of the yūshō race — one win clear of a four‑way chase group at 7‑2 (Atamifuji, Fujinokawa, Churanoumi, Kinbozan). Higher up the banzuke, Ozeki Kirishima was pulled down by Komusubi Daieisho and slipped to 5‑4, while fellow Ozeki Aonishiki improved to 6‑3 with a beltless‑arm throw over Yoshinofuji. Force‑outs and push‑outs — the tournament's two most common finishes overall — accounted for less than half of the day's twenty bouts this time, with hand‑pull‑downs almost as frequent. Jūryō call‑up Sadanoumi, filling in for an absent wrestler, lost his manga debut to Tokihayate by yorikiri.","jp":"秋場所９日目、横綱・大の里が藤凌駕を引き落としで下して8勝1敗とし、優勝争いの単独トップを守った—— 7勝2敗で追う熱海富士・藤ノ川・美ノ海・金峰山の4人を1差でリード。上位では大関・霧島が小結・大栄翔に引き落としで敗れて5勝4敗となる一方、大関・安青錨はすくい投げで義ノ富士を降し6勝3敗とした。この日は寄り切り・押し出しの決まり手が全体の半数に届かず、引き落としもほぼ同数だった。十両から呼ばれた佐田の海は、マンガ初登場を時疾風に寄り切りで飾れなかった。"}};
